{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And you shall observe this thing</b> — this is the matter of the paschal offering itself, concerning which He said above (Exodus 12:21), \"and you shall slaughter the paschal lamb.\" And if it seems far-fetched [to refer it] to that, [then it refers] not to the application of the blood adjacent to it, for concerning that they were commanded only in the Passover of Egypt, as He said (Exodus 12:23), \"and HaShem will pass over and see the blood,\" etc. And likewise, \"and you shall observe this service\" (Exodus 12:25), [means] the paschal sacrifice. And similar to this is (Deuteronomy 15:17), \"and also to your maidservant you shall do thus.\""], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:06:12.666373043Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}